This package is the agent behind the AbacusAIBot desktop app. It contains the
session, tools, permission gate, and harness. The package is private and is
never published. The desktop build compiles it into its own output.

This product includes software developed at Abacus.AI:

  - The agent harness (guardrails, syntax check, output repair, verify loop,
    budgets) is ported from codingagent-lite
    (https://github.com/abacusai/codingagent-lite), MIT License.

This product depends on software from third parties:

  - pi / @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent (https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono)
    by Mario Zechner, MIT License. The agent loop, provider layer and extension
    model are pi's; this package adapts them to AbacusAIBot's NDJSON protocol and
    wraps them in the harness above.

  - ast-grep (https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep), MIT License. Structural
    search and edit, loaded as a native addon at run time.
